  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wide frying pan over medium heat. Add the onion and red bell pepper and cook for 6 to 8 minutes, stirring often, until softened and starting to turn golden.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, paprika, ground coriander, and cayenne. Cook for 30 seconds, stirring, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the canned tomatoes, tomato paste, salt, and black pepper. Simmer for 8 to 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Make 4 small wells in the sauce and crack an egg into each one. Cover the pan and cook for 4 to 6 minutes, until the whites are set but the yolks are still soft, or longer if you prefer firmer yolks.",
    "Scatter over the parsley and serve immediately with warm bread for dipping."
  ],
